{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d555962b030f8b57f8d51f78a5b0f13bb3624a6c19c886ebc7fe3d28a836fb76",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c298f6790bc79c54eb2b608cf1e67475c29b572919bfd2ac491a12b112b7bb44",
      "text": "吾主。我如今触及了南国供品及其素材深藏的\n潜能，正欲习得全新之术式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8965aafe5a777e8f4bd1dbb3107b2f06259f41f35cf890decc8a156040920d",
      "text": "此番发现，必定能成为提高我所精炼的供品\n魔力之基石！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1428a619d9da6f90a8def61b6c3b53e725c281ca60823fbcb98ff905246c6075",
      "text": "您现在在哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:616188ed8d8fed21e3f2c1ba45221c9d2b65aa4d6bf5dbe826cad971514b3610",
      "text": "发生什么事了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76518c1168889e893d4152f45823bd31a66236e9ed39431fb301a77958eeac76",
      "text": "我正在一间写着“海之家”的店里，确认其款待的\n供品之真正价值。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e01e26d24acd5656b6289897b70fc5daab0f687d22f33713e4f6163cc2186cd",
      "text": "多数不过是我等之街市亦能目睹的平凡之物……\n但是！我察觉到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01643ffedeef4b8f6e4f4020cdf0d208e62b943790ba80205b364cba9bb6f75b",
      "text": "那些矮小之人们争相求购的金黄泪珠，\n呈现出了非同寻常的模样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46ef8923eae8e523212796b07caafbc9e216bb107d49736fe1b1d05dca874f29",
      "text": "这独特的香气……与我已然习得的\n精炼术似乎有所不同。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd641df64ba5feb488fe6f206d98b0b53d75760ae910525a9548f5af7a43983",
      "text": "是热带果汁\n吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:600422df6bfda338b2f787eff40a3c2542c503939b0d907051f2068f044e04fa",
      "text": "是椰子的\n香气吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4678d76232878a05ec2d17d1d6686d6b4115b472a33ecd0db29a46a494c53e99",
      "text": "吾主亦知晓么。只要交给我，复制这等魔术并将其\n编入全新术式之中亦是易如反掌！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26a2bcfd2a77b2afaeb6d952f7ed2d03ab4b0500edc6cc6cbfac250ec0fd548d",
      "text": "诱惑着矮小之人的这香气之真面目……\n若是庄一郎的话，或许早已能驾驭自如了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affefb991d00a5a5b5bc2b4f20ad2c2a7c9aeee537d2e413c6625090d486a57b",
      "text": "在太阳沉落、归还黑暗巢穴的时辰到来之前，\n我当探明这罪孽深重之香气的源头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_402_2_4_029_02_09_b:2_4_029_02_09_b:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec6b96f9a5853b9f4141bcb147e6c8e2a3dd78ba22273b3ac1cd6cda61395fc",
      "text": "待成功习得全新魔术之时，我亦将向吾主\n献上极上供品。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
